# Secrets — never commit
*.key
*.pem
*.token
secrets/

# SOPS. sites/*/secrets.enc.yaml IS committed — that is the point, it is
# encrypted. These are the plaintext working forms that must never be:
sites/*/secrets.yaml
sites/*/secrets.plain.yaml
sites/*/*.dec.yaml
# age private keys, wherever someone leaves one
*.agekey
age-key*.txt
keys.txt

# Generated during install
# GENERATED ON THE MANAGEMENT NODE by install.sh. They exist only there, and a
# repo sync must not remove them: an `rsync --delete` from a dev checkout wiped
# these mid-install once, and the edge helm upgrade then failed with
#   Kubernetes cluster unreachable: stat ./kubeconfig-cai-lfs3
# If you sync this repo onto a live management node, exclude them explicitly —
# being gitignored does not protect a file from rsync --delete.
kubeconfig-*
join-token-*
ais-edge-ca.crt
ca-bundle.crt

# Cloud-provider credentials — anything matching these names is a shell
# script of `export KEY=...` lines and must never be committed. Operators
# point CLOUD_CREDENTIALS_FILE at one of these (or any path outside the
# repo).
openrc*.sh
*-openrc.sh
aws-creds*.sh
gcp-creds*.sh
azure-creds*.sh

# OS files
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Orthanc routing file

# Operator-edited per-site Orthanc deidentification profiles (copy from .template)

# Local planning / working notes — not part of the deliverable
docs/cai-lfs3-deployment-plan.md
docs/alerting-reclaimer-todo.md
docs/zip-metadata-extraction-xnat-plan.md

# Personal review notes — not part of the deliverable.
docs/BEHAVIOUR-CHANGES.md

# Run artefacts from scripts/adopt-existing.sh: a record of what one specific
# live cluster adopted, timestamped per run. Output, not source.
adoption-records/

# Bootstrap bundles produced by scripts/06b-make-bootstrap.sh for `join: bundle`
# sites. Each EMBEDS THAT EDGE'S JOIN TOKEN — a bearer credential that grants
# cluster membership — so one must never be committed. Root-anchored so it
# cannot swallow scripts/files/edge-join.sh or scripts/06c-post-join.sh, which
# are source.
/*-join.sh
/join-token-*.expires
